OL,3,C'Very noticeable' fuel price rises
OL,4,Cpinching pockets as inflation grows
OL,6,FDrivers in the Channel Islands say
OL,7,Fthey are increasingly feeling the
OL,8,Fpinch due to rising fuel costs.
OL,10,FBoth Guernsey and Jersey's latest
OL,11,Frates of inflation have gone up, with
OL,12,Ffuel prices being the biggest
OL,13,Fcontributor to this change due to
OL,14,Fshipping disruption in the Strait of
OL,15,FHormuz amid tensions in the Middle
OL,16,FEast.
OL,18,FLast week, crude oil prices hit 100 US
OL,19,Fdollars per barrel for the first time
OL,20,Fsince May.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/6
