OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F354A1785426508
OL,3,C'Very noticeable' fuel price rises
OL,4,Cpinching pockets as inflation grows
OL,6,FGuernsey's inflation - the rate at
OL,7,Fwhich the cost of goods increase over
OL,8,Ftime - stands at 4.3%, which is 0.4%
OL,9,Fhigher than it was in the 12 months up
OL,10,Fto June 2025.
OL,12,FIn Jersey, it is 2.8%, which is 0.2%
OL,13,Fabove the year up to June 2025.
OL,15,FJersey's annual inflation rate is
OL,16,Froughly comparable with that of the
OL,17,FUK, which sits at 2.6%.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/6
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,355,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F354A1785426508
OL,3,C'Very noticeable' fuel price rises
OL,4,Cpinching pockets as inflation grows
OL,6,FInflation still remains significantly
OL,7,Flower than it was at the end of 2022,
OL,8,Fwhen Jersey's rate stood at 12.7% and
OL,9,FGuernsey's rose to 8.5%.
OL,11,FITV News spoke to Channel Islanders at
OL,12,Fthe petrol pumps about the "very
OL,13,Fnoticeable" pressure that higher
OL,14,Fprices were putting on them.
OL,16,FOne taxi driver said: "It keeps rising
OL,17,Fand it's quite tough. We do long hours
OL,18,Fso the petrol I go through on a 10-
OL,19,Fhour shift is a lot of money.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/6
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,355,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F354A1785426508
OL,3,C'Very noticeable' fuel price rises
OL,4,Cpinching pockets as inflation grows
OL,6,F"I try not to think about it because
OL,7,Fobviously, you've got a job to do. You
OL,8,Fjust have to kind of deal with it."
OL,10,FAnother said: "I'm worried, not from a
OL,11,Fpersonal perspective but it's putting
OL,12,Fa lot of people into a lot of
OL,13,Fdifficulties.
OL,15,F"The cost of living, life's getting
OL,16,Fincreasingly difficult. There seems to
OL,17,Fbe a disconnect between the haves and
OL,18,Fthe have nots."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/6
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
