OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,355,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F354A1785426508
OL,3,C'Very noticeable' fuel price rises
OL,4,Cpinching pockets as inflation grows
OL,6,FInflation measures the average
OL,7,Fincrease in the prices of goods and
OL,8,Fservices over a period of time which
OL,9,Fmeans the change in cost of some
OL,10,Fproducts, including fuel, can be
OL,11,Fdrastically different to the overall
OL,12,Frate of inflation.
OL,14,FIn the last year, Guernsey has seen
OL,15,Fthe biggest shift in the price of oil,
OL,16,Felectricity, coal and gas with prices
OL,17,Fgoing up by 19%, while Jersey's petrol
OL,18,Fand oil prices grew by 18%.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G5/6
